(
    title: "Trick Shot",
    developer: Some("Dennis Koble"),
    description: Some("Pocket billiards with three target balls and a cue: rotate the cue around the ball to aim, then hold the button to build power — the longer the hold, the harder the strike. Leaning the stick while you hold applies spin, and beyond pool and English billiards there are nine practice puzzles that each want a ball sunk in a single shot."),
